3. EQUIPMENT & WEAPON SYSTEMS
================================================================================

Smithy (unlocks at Capital level 3, VERIFIED):
- Equipment offers: choose 1 of 3 options; reroll unlimited times
- New equipment choices unlock at Smithy level 1 / 3 / 5 / 7 / 12 / 14 / 16 / 20
- Cast Craft: finish the equipment, costs wood + stone + iron
- Recast: reset the equipment's random attributes

Exclusive Equipment (VERIFIED):
- Max 2 per session: 1st at Smithy level 10, 2nd at Smithy level 18
- Chosen from troop types owned at the Barracks (free choice among owned types)
- Structure: 2 random effects (from normal equipment pool) + 1 special effect
  restricted to a single troop type
- Smelt: add effects from normal equipment into the exclusive equipment,
  costs 1 nail; unlocks at Smithy 14/20 (1st exclusive) and 18/20 (2nd)
- Recast on exclusive: 1 random attribute can be locked with nails so the
  recast preserves that attribute and its effect

Related Resources (VERIFIED):
- Nails: from Stone plots at level 5
- Iron: from Crop plots (50%) and Stone plots
- Exp Scroll: from Crop plots (50%) and Wood plots
- Scroll (instant troop level-up): from Wood plots at level 5

NOTE: The previous equipment slots/rarity colors/weapon types and named items
(Lu Bu's Halberd etc.) here were unverified fabrications and have been removed.
Equipment effect details must be re-captured from the Weapon screenshot folder.

